	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["57B0727D357856C6"]
			description: [
				"Some say Worldroot is the remnants of an older existence, before the world grew to where it is today. Some say it was from a time where man and monster worked as one. Whatever their origin, &6&oWorldroot remains a powerful material&r."
				"Found embedded in Deepslate and close to the bedrock of the Overworld, Worldroot is especially tough, &6&orequiring at least a diamond tier pickaxe to mine&r. This toughness seems to transfer over to smelting as well, as only the power of a &6&oDraconic Crucible&r can turn this ancient essence into usable ingots of history."
			]
			id: "7756E05A9E7AB29F"
			tasks: [{
				count: 4L
				id: "46F95B3F44E41A2B"
				item: "saintsdragons:worldroot_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Ingots of Origin"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["66BA8C0F224F38F0"]
			description: [
				"The aptly named &6&oDraconic Crucible&r is a powerful workstation crafted with Ancient Dragonite Fragments, a long forgotten material found in Ancient Cities, Nether Fortresses, and Bastions. The Crucible requires strong sources of heat such as &6&oBlaze Powder or Searing Coals&r to function, but can create some spectacular items."
				"Or you can use it as the world's most badass furnace, I guess. "
			]
			id: "57B0727D357856C6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "24FD1F7D49D434CF"
				item: "saintsdragons:draconic_crucible"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Doom's Furnace"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["149BF56B98224AAF"]
			description: [
				"Vestige"
				"You've done well to make it this far. My hope in your actions grows ever more with each block you break, each item you craft, each entity you interact with."
				"Things will only get harder from here. Time is something nobody can avoid, and the clock is forever ticking."
				"For now, celebrate as you venture forwards evermore."
			]
			id: "3A6E403F44FFE7AA"
			tasks: [{
				id: "11DA5FF0BBE82DCD"
