		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A6E403F44FFE7AA"]
			description: ["Taverns are small buildings offering rest and food via the villagers housed there. Most notably, however, they are a source of structure maps, each showing the location of a specific structure. For an explorer, there's no better method, except maybe special eyes."]
