		{
			dependencies: ["3AAB0E864C590306"]
			description: [
				"The tower of &6The Night Lich&r is a large and forboding. While one may discover it naturally along their travels, an easier way of locating one would be to use Soul Stars, dropped from killing undead mobs. Do be aware, however, that &6&oyou need 4 soul stars&r to place in each Chiseled Stone Alter, summoning the boss."
				"The Night Lich itself is a powerful sorcerer, attacking from afar with magic while levitating high off the ground, you would best be ready to match its projectiles with your own. Phantoms called upon by the lich will be brutal obstacles in your battle, but do not worry too much, for they are merely phantoms."
				"&6&oBe ready for a long ranged fight, take care of your surroundings, and the Night Lich will die once more. &r"
			]
			icon: "bosses_of_mass_destruction:ancient_anima"
			id: "3CDD48DCA161A352"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 200L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "7D472196578D7541"
