			}]
			title: "A Crystal Bloom"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A6E403F44FFE7AA"]
			description: ["The Ancient Builders were said to have retreated underground long ago, building &6&osprawling cities within the Deepslate caves&r. How unfortunate, then, that in doing so, they flew too close to the sun and &6&oopened a gateway to The Otherside&r, welcoming in The Warden and its sculking mass. If you find such a relic, you are sure to obtain some truly wonderful loot."]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
