		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A6E403F44FFE7AA"]
			description: ["&6&oThe Ferrous Wroughtnaut&r offers a unique challenge. Located underground in buried chambers, it dons impenetrable armor not even the strongest blade can pierce. Or perhaps not, for there remains a single blade, a crack in its armor, from a past fight. &o&6Wait for it to reveal its weak point and then strike, and you may claim the Armored Eye&r."]
			icon: "mowziesmobs:wrought_helmet"
