		{
			dependencies: ["7756E05A9E7AB29F"]
			description: [
				"If you've tamed any kind of dragon, you've likely wanted to travel with it. Unfortunately, this can prove difficult with some species. But fear not, for there exists a means to carry your scaly companion with you."
				"A Dragon Binder when bound to a tamed dragon will &6&ostore their very being inside it&r, allowing you to release it whenever and wherever you see fit. But these items are not simple to make. Each requires a &6&oDragon Binder Core&r, made from Worldroot, Echo Shards, and a &6&oDragon Seal Stone&r, found in chests of structures such as Ancient Cities and Strongholds."
			]
			id: "4777E3CA84CDFCCB"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6DEA912A0757788A"
				item: "saintsdragons:dragon_binder_core"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "To Bind a Beast"
			x: -0.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["25E290F19A2CCAF7"]
			description: ["Nobody quite knows who created the Ancient Factory, only that it remains alive, guarded by dutiful Watchers, Prowlers, and the unfinished form of &o&6The Harbinger&r. Found deep underground, this factory holds many a treasure, but to one searching for &6&oThe Legendary Eyes&r, none is greather than that which is embedded in The Harbinger's metallic body."]
			icon: "cataclysm:mech_eye"
			id: "0F649DD652FB7582"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3A72EC7DB20F3606"
				structure: "cataclysm:ancient_factory"
				title: "Find The Ancient Factory"
				type: "structure"
			}]
			title: "Mechanized Warfare"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2A0422E6DF854E64"]
			description: [
				"Deep underground lie the &6&oCatacombs&r, burial sites of an ancient necromancer and his army. A wayward compass may show you the way to one of these locations, and exploration will reward you with treasures of arcane power. It also remains home of &6&oThe Dead King, holder of The Undead Eye&r."
				"A powerful necromancer indeed, The Dead King will cast a variety of deadly spells, &o&6from slashes of blood to to poison arrows, and even raising the dead to fight under it&r. And do not fool yourself into thinking it is weak in close quarters, for it still holds its staff, a powerful bludgeoning tool."
				"&6&oBe quick on your feet, bring plenty of potions, and The Undead Eye may be yours to claim.&r"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "irons_spellbooks:wayward_compass"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "25E290F19A2CCAF7"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3E15CDBC2DA7B94D"
					structure: "irons_spellbooks:catacombs"
					title: "Find The Catacombs"
					type: "structure"
				}
				{
					entity: "irons_spellbooks:dead_king"
					id: "004F0805FEF6831A"
					title: "Slay The Dead King"
					type: "kill"
					value: 1L
				}
			]
			title: "Stay Dead"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A6E403F44FFE7AA"]
			id: "3C31DF9EB32C9238"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7F343A299E51CEBF"
				item: "supplementaries:cartographers_quill"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -1.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0F649DD652FB7582"]
			description: [
				"The Harbinger is a deadly machine, utilizing the full power of the Nether Star used to power it mixed with ancient technology. To fight one is to fight that which combats destruction incarnate. &6&oFire resistance can prove vital as its barrage of lasers set you ablaze, and the wither effect corrupts you from your very core.&r"
				"The Harbinger does not care for life, and targets whatever is in its vicinity, an important thing to note if fighting in a group. &6&oSwitching between lasers and missiles&r can quickly turn the tides of the battle if not prepared, as can the exploding Wither Howlitzers. The Harbinger's shield, brought up upon &6&otaking 50% damage, blocks projectiles&r, leading to a close quarters fight. It seems as if the creators knew its power, however, as several columns with &6&olever activated EMPs&r have been left for usage."
				"&6&oKeep aware of your surroundings, listen closely for the mechanical hiss of changing weaponry, and use the arena to your advantage, so that you may claim the Mechanical Eye.&r"
			]
			icon: "goety_cataclysm:mechanized_core"
			id: "0EB209B2B41E6921"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "cataclysm:the_harbinger"
				id: "5003977D886CEA0C"
				title: "Kill The Harbinger"
				type: "kill"
				value: 1L
			}]
			title: "Self Destruct Sequence"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A6E403F44FFE7AA"]
			id: "24A1DE3BA5E7E971"
			tasks: [{
				biome: "#forge:is_desert"
				icon: "immersive_weathering:sand_layer_block"
